# Showcase MVVM Rules

This is a **reference demo app**, not part of the NuGet framework.

## Structure

- Composition root: `Composition/AppComposition.cs`
- Page registry: `Composition/PagesCatalog.cs` (explicit tuples, no convention discovery)
- ViewModels: `ViewModels/` — pages inherit `PageViewModel`
- Views/Pages: `Views/`, `Pages/` with `x:DataType` for compiled bindings

## ViewModel patterns

- Base: `ObservableObject` from `MyNet.Observable`
- Commands: inject `ICommandFactory` (via `AvaloniaCommandFactory`)
- Localized properties: `[UpdateOnCultureChanged]` attribute
- Navigation pages: implement `INavigationPage` lifecycle methods

## New demo page checklist

1. `{Name}PageViewModel` inheriting `PageViewModel` or `ShowcaseViewModel`
2. `{Name}Page.axaml` with `x:DataType="vm:{Name}PageViewModel"`
3. Entry in `PagesCatalog.cs`
4. Register ViewModel singleton in `AppComposition.RegisterPageViewModels`
5. `.resx` resources if user-facing text

## Validation sample

See `FormViewModel` + `FormViewModelValidator` (FluentValidation + `INotifyDataErrorInfo`).

Do not move Showcase patterns into `src/` library packages.
